{"slug": "graph-comparison", "title": "Graph Comparison", "blocks": [{"id": "b1", "type": "ingress", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "This is the working doc the whole vault exists for — Obsidian's default graph params (the reference we match) mapped to Barkpark's Graph Renderer counterparts, with a delta checklist still to close."}]}, {"id": "b2", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "The reference is Obsidian's default "}, {"type": "text", "value": "graph.json", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": ". The target is the Graph View driven by "}, {"type": "text", "value": "bp-graph.js", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " (the Graph Renderer) on a hand-rolled velocity-Verlet Force Simulation with Cytoscape gutted. Open this vault (start at Welcome) in both graphs side by side and work the checklist."}]}, {"id": "b3", "type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Parameter map"}, {"id": "b4", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "| Obsidian param | Reference value | Barkpark counterpart | Current state | |---|---|---|---| | "}, {"type": "text", "value": "centerStrength", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " | 0.5187 | centering pull in the force simulation | not yet matched to 0.5187 | | "}, {"type": "text", "value": "repelStrength", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " | 10 | node repulsion | ~2.7x baseline (not calibrated to 10) | | "}, {"type": "text", "value": "linkStrength", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " | 1 | spring stiffness | needs to map to 1.0 | | "}, {"type": "text", "value": "linkDistance", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " | 250 | spring rest length | rest length differs from 250 | | "}, {"type": "text", "value": "textFadeMultiplier", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " | 0 | label fade threshold | fit-relative fade (option A), not 0 | | "}, {"type": "text", "value": "nodeSizeMultiplier", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "